{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wild Dose is a first-person horror game set between an oppressive megalopolis and virtual drug sessions. Thanks to an evolving dialogue system, you'll meet a cast of characters with conflicting goals and make choices that will shape this fractured world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost your job. Lost your apartment. Lost everyone.<br>Just you \u2014 ready to take on any contract to avoid sleeping on the streets \u2014 and your trusty AI, endlessly repeating the same ad: Fresh Air\u2122 \u2013 Let Nature come to you!<br>But you\u2019ve heard a rumor.<br>A black market program, spreading quietly.<br>Illegal. Unstable. Liberating.<br>They call it Wild Dose. No license. No limits. No tech support.<br>Just total disconnection.<br>And really\u2026 what do you have left to lose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lose your grip on reality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between suffocating streets, digital hallucinations, and unsettling encounters.<br>This city means you harm.<br>But are your toxic trips any safer than its alleyways?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/extras/94e41d0f67e6f05c1aa9bdfa100d9a40.poster.avif?t=1769532937\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/extras/94e41d0f67e6f05c1aa9bdfa100d9a40.webm?t=1769532937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/extras/94e41d0f67e6f05c1aa9bdfa100d9a40.mp4?t=1769532937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nothing will ever be the same</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The population has grown tired of legal virtual drugs.<br>A storm is brewing.<br>And you're running out of time, money... and sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An immersive environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Wild Dose reacts to how you play.<br>Choose your approach for each mission: stealth, dialogue, or confrontation.<br>The decisions you make, the factions you support, and the relationships you build will shape the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A psychological nightmare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality fades. Your senses deceive you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unforgiving narrative</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a side. Lives will be shattered \u2014 maybe even yours.<br>You can always escape into the virtual to forget this merciless reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/extras/7a3aa43689421d40b90179883e573e51.poster.avif?t=1769532937\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/extras/7a3aa43689421d40b90179883e573e51.webm?t=1769532937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/extras/7a3aa43689421d40b90179883e573e51.mp4?t=1769532937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1555790?t=1769532937","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1555790?t=1769532937","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769532937","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769532937","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of drug or alcohol abuse.\r\nPhysical violence, use of axes, guns or other weapons, blood and bodily disfigurement, all in retro PSX style. Suggestive themes."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wild Dose is a first-person horror game set between an oppressive megalopolis and virtual drug sessions. Thanks to an evolving dialogue system, you'll meet a cast of characters with conflicting goals and make choices that will shape this fractured world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost your job. Lost your apartment. Lost everyone.<br>Just you \u2014 ready to take on any contract to avoid sleeping on the streets \u2014 and your trusty AI, endlessly repeating the same ad: Fresh Air\u2122 \u2013 Let Nature come to you!<br>But you\u2019ve heard a rumor.<br>A black market program, spreading quietly.<br>Illegal. Unstable. Liberating.<br>They call it Wild Dose. No license. No limits. No tech support.<br>Just total disconnection.<br>And really\u2026 what do you have left to lose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lose your grip on reality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between suffocating streets, digital hallucinations, and unsettling encounters.<br>This city means you harm.<br>But are your toxic trips any safer than its alleyways?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/extras/94e41d0f67e6f05c1aa9bdfa100d9a40.poster.avif?t=1769532937\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1555790/extras/94e41d0f67e6f05c1aa9bdfa100d9a40.webm?t=1769532937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=v